Prahasta says gods cannot assail Rāvaṇa --- Prahasta promises monkeyless earth and guard --- Durmukha deems insult unpardonable --- Durmukha vows alone slay monkeys everywhere --- Vajradaṃṣṭra dismisses Hanumān aiming at Rāma --- Vajradaṃṣṭra vows club-kill Rāma party alone --- Nikumbha vows alone kill Rāghava Lakṣmaṇa --- Vajrahanu vows devour chiefs while others feast